  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Riding on that Midnight Train**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [6]\n- **Pancho and Lefty (Solo BS)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [6]\n- **enc brake**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Ol’ Slewfoot [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **bs2019-12-20.bs2019-12-20mg21flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 122 min; rated 2.5/5 by 2 [1]\n- **bs2019-12-20.bs2019-12-20flac24mg21**: source not stated; 21 songs; 122 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The Jefferson Theater in Charlottesville was sold out for the December 20 show [7]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **bs2019-12-20.bs2019-12-20mg21flac16**: taped by George Heston; transferred by George Heston; source: microtech gefell mg 21 (hypers)> Nbob active cable > Nbox Platinum > P2(oade mod acm)24/48 [1]\n- **bs2019-12-20.bs2019-12-20flac24mg21**: taped by George Heston; transferred by George Heston; source: microtech gefell mg 21 (hypers)> Nbob active cable > Nbox Platinum > P2(oade mod acm)24/48 [2]. Also: The uploader labeled the files 2019 by mistake; the show was actually played on December 20, 2018 [5]",
